{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roboholic is a unique roguelite first-person shooter where a beer-brewing robot takes matters into its metallic hands. Use deadly &quot;alco-guns,&quot; experiment with insane implants, and race through levels, leaving nothing but chaos in your wake. Build your beer empire and revel in the madness of a world where retro-futuristic style meets epic battles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No obstacles can stand in your way! Use the destructible environment as a weapon and change your strategy on the fly. Reduce levels to rubble and find innovative ways to annihilate your enemies.  <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/ShotgunSteamShow_2.gif?t=1741105090\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own combat style! Choose from a massive arsenal of unusual weapons with unique effects. Every weapon brings something special to the battlefield, turning every fight into a dazzling spectacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/For_Steam_Electric_Forks_2.gif?t=1741105090\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achieve engineering perfection! Enhance your robot with experimental implants. Unlock new abilities and obliterate your foes with even greater power and flair.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/Steam_Show_abilities_2.gif?t=1741105090\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the charm of retro-futurism! Explore the mesmerizing landscapes of a strange planet, marvel at stylish levels, and soak in an atmosphere inspired by the futuristic dreams of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/Steam_ShowLevels.gif?t=1741105090\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/690210?t=1741105090","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741105090","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741105090","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741105090","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Have some alcohol thematics in game - weapons firing with beer.\r\nAlso player building it own bar in the hub."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roboholic is a unique roguelite first-person shooter where a beer-brewing robot takes matters into its metallic hands. Use deadly &quot;alco-guns,&quot; experiment with insane implants, and race through levels, leaving nothing but chaos in your wake. Build your beer empire and revel in the madness of a world where retro-futuristic style meets epic battles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No obstacles can stand in your way! Use the destructible environment as a weapon and change your strategy on the fly. Reduce levels to rubble and find innovative ways to annihilate your enemies.  <